{
  "description": "Six Arduino + nRF24L01+ sensors around a hub in a house (1 Mbps, channel 76). Sensors send 8-byte readings every 2 s (+-200 ms) with auto-ACK; the hub listens on pipes 1-2, sensors 5-7 address the hub's second pipe.",
